<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20407" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is fed</i> or <i>fatted</i>: in pl.,
				<i>fatted beasts, cattle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				762
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				677
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.6.6
			</span></i>; of sheep, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				576
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				494
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμῆς χερὸς β.</span>, of
			horses, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1356
			</span></i> (lyr.); of dogs, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.1.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆν ἀπὸ βοσκημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1319a20
				</span></i>
			: dual, of a couple of pigs, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				811
			</span></i>: sg., of <i>a single beast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκανθα ποντίου β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					275.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τρόπῳ βοσκήματος πιαινόμενον ζῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					807a
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρίον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>MM</u>
				1204a38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>food</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. πηυονῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					620
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				364
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				892
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναίματον β. δαιμόνων</span>
			<i>prey</i> drained of blood by the Erinyes, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				302
			</span></i>.</div>
